{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"636706468116037642","content":"You are half mad son. And trust me I don't like saying no to yeh. But crew quarters are cramped enough. And if I were to do no work with my own slave aboard, captain amaya would flay me and set me adrift with nought but a bottle like this one and send me to make friends with an aboleth.","created_at":"2020-07-19T09:51:08.267000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"734346580400013342","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
